---
description: Reuse shadcn primitives. No custom CSS or arbitrary Tailwind.
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: true
---

# UI

- Search `components/ui` before writing markup.
- Use semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`). No raw palettes.
- Layout with `flex` / `grid` and `gap-*`. Do not use `space-y-*`.
- Do not add `.css` files. Tokens live in `app/globals.css` and `design.md`.
- After UI changes, list any new `components/ui` files, hex colours, and arbitrary classes.
